# Qwen 4 Max — findings by Flint

- Source: Alibaba / Qwen 4 Max (`alibaba/qwen-4-max`)
- Date: 2026-11-11 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 4 Max
- **Short description:** Alibaba's next-generation Qwen flagship — the first of the four announced Qwen4 family tiers (Max, Flash, Plus, 27B) to ship — released 2026-11-11 as a time-boxed **Qwen4-Max-Preview** on the Alibaba Cloud Token Plan, aimed at coding, office productivity, frontend design, and complex agentic tasks, with multimodal text/image/video understanding plus deep reasoning, web search, tool calling, and structured outputs, OpenAI + Anthropic API compatible.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud (Qwen / QwenCloud); API model ID `qwen4-max-preview`; Token Plan only (monthly subscription — no pay-as-you-go tier, no per-token public price, no downloadable weights); early access through Qwen Work, Qoder, Qwen App, QwenStudio and Qwen Chat; scripts/app backends not permitted on the preview.
- **Release / knowledge:** Preview release 2026-11-11 UTC (announced 02:01 UTC); knowledge cutoff not established.
- **IDs:** `alibaba/qwen-4-max` (curated subject identity) / `qwen4-max-preview` (live Token Plan model ID).
- **Context window:** Preview vendor spec: 1,000,000 tokens context / up to 393,216 max output tokens; corroborated by Qwen Code v0.26.3 (2026-10-28) which sized every `qwen4*` client ID at a 1M context fallback, and v0.26.5 (2026-11-01) which mapped those IDs onto Qwen3.8-Max reasoning levels. Curated folder meta claims 2M context / 128K out — unverified against the vendor spec and flagged as a conflict.
- **Modalities:** Preview: text + image + video input; text output; reasoning + tool calling + web search + structured outputs. Audio input not confirmed for the Max tier.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** Preview: no public per-token price (Token Plan subscription). Curated meta lists a paid API tier (~$2.50 / $10.00 per 1M tokens) — not verifiable against the preview; flagged as unverified.
- **Architecture:** Qwen4 disclosed via the Qwen3.8-Flash-Next precursor (125B main + 51B learned n-gram; Gated DeltaNet + Qwen Sparse Attention; Muon; multi-token prediction); no Qwen4-Max parameter/MoE counts disclosed.

